{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and pick up. If heavy, go to storage, deposit and complete task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = GoToStorageArea    /> <Action ID = DepositObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CompleteSpecificTask    />",
